# vim-ai-helper agent rules

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) in full. Summary:

- Fedora RPM deps only for runtime (`python3-openai`, `python3-ollama`; optional `python3-google-genai`). No pip-only runtime deps.
- Never commit secrets, local `agents.json`, `*.prompt`, `prompts/`, or chat/history dumps. Keep `agents.json.example` safe and non-injected.
- Preserve CLI commands and `VIM_AI_*` env contract used by vim-ai-assistant and devenv.
- Do not weaken `.gitignore`, Bandit/CI, or Packit current-Fedora targets.
- Verify with `python3 -m py_compile vim-ai-helper`, `./vim-ai-helper agents`, `./vim-ai-helper route complete`.
